        df_rep = P_SERIES * (n_rep - 1)
        precision_table += f"    {conc:.1e}:\n"
        precision_table += f"      BW={bw:.1f}%, Rep={rep:.1f}%\n"
        precision_table += f"      n={n_rep}, df_rep={df_rep}\n"

    summary_text = f"""
    PRECISION MODEL SUMMARY
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

    Using CHI-SQUARE Distribution
    (Correct for variance uncertainty!)

    Global Parameters:
      • Series (p) = {P_SERIES}
      • df_BW = {DF_BW}
{precision_table}
    CORRECTED MODEL:
    Y sampled independently for each
    replicate - averaging works!

    Variance reduces by √n factor

    Model Structure:
      For each replicate:
        Y_rep ~ N(Y_mean, Y_std)
        X_rep = Quadratic(Y_rep)
                + BW_error + Rep_error
      X_final = mean(X_rep across n)

    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
